{"3376290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "海蓝星之梦", "steam_appid": 3376290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4106350, 4106360], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/3c0b4bc59a8c055995fbec5f991af473.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/3c0b4bc59a8c055995fbec5f991af473.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dreams of Earth</i>    is a multi-ending sci-fi romance visual novel (ADV) set in a futuristic world. It tells the story of Nameless, an astronaut from a distant planet, and Xiaoxi, a bionic girl from Azure Star Academy. The game explores themes of bionic humans, pure romance, and teacher-student relationships, with an estimated playtime of 6–8 hours, featuring rich storytelling and numerous CG illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/1590bc7529c2af20f7e9a3465842c878.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/1590bc7529c2af20f7e9a3465842c878.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/a7c301af10a7f2e59e95d341bfeab108.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/a7c301af10a7f2e59e95d341bfeab108.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=539 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/6a5cffdbc93ae376832682c265cc6060.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/6a5cffdbc93ae376832682c265cc6060.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/3fb944df46fd7a90c3d39a39002d7c7f.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/3fb944df46fd7a90c3d39a39002d7c7f.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=2446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/edf358e4004aeb69c96dd512066099df.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/edf358e4004aeb69c96dd512066099df.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are PygmaGame, an independent Chinese visual novel (galgame) development team. Our team members previously worked on <i>Shore of Sky</i>. Inspired by works such as <i>Planetarian</i>, <i>Stella of the End</i>, and <i>ATRI -My Dear Moments-</i>, combined with the lead writer's passion for science fiction and extensive reading of Golden Age sci-fi classics (plus, bionic humans are adorable), we set out to create this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STAFF LIST：</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Director</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >辰火</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Scriptwriter</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >剧本&amp;演出：辰火</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >剧本协力：R号机</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>PROGRAMMER</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>主程序：空白</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI程序：孤晚的爱上夜晚</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >程序协力：浅唱</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>ART</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >人物立绘&amp;CG插画：Ratto</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >机器人立绘：ゆ龍</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >场景插画：34</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q版插画：ゆ龍、浮游</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI设计：冷淡</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>VA</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >小希cv：云生</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >影cv：樱酱</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MUSIC</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PV音乐：雨观</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>BGM、音效收集：R号机</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>OTHER</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>PV制作：Season</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >主题曲（ed）制作：Whilist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >周边制作：予薇</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>OTHER HELP</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >浅唱、无语死了、祖安青年、苏格拉没有底、达瓦里氏、本夕、小水星、昼伏夜出的黯白猫猫、忆与秋叶、清弈云时</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>THANKS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过摩点赞助《海蓝星之梦》的各位玩家！</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/3c0b4bc59a8c055995fbec5f991af473.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/3c0b4bc59a8c055995fbec5f991af473.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dreams of Earth</i>    is a multi-ending sci-fi romance visual novel (ADV) set in a futuristic world. It tells the story of Nameless, an astronaut from a distant planet, and Xiaoxi, a bionic girl from Azure Star Academy. The game explores themes of bionic humans, pure romance, and teacher-student relationships, with an estimated playtime of 6–8 hours, featuring rich storytelling and numerous CG illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/1590bc7529c2af20f7e9a3465842c878.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/1590bc7529c2af20f7e9a3465842c878.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/a7c301af10a7f2e59e95d341bfeab108.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/a7c301af10a7f2e59e95d341bfeab108.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=539 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/6a5cffdbc93ae376832682c265cc6060.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/6a5cffdbc93ae376832682c265cc6060.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/3fb944df46fd7a90c3d39a39002d7c7f.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/3fb944df46fd7a90c3d39a39002d7c7f.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=2446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/edf358e4004aeb69c96dd512066099df.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/edf358e4004aeb69c96dd512066099df.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are PygmaGame, an independent Chinese visual novel (galgame) development team. Our team members previously worked on <i>Shore of Sky</i>. Inspired by works such as <i>Planetarian</i>, <i>Stella of the End</i>, and <i>ATRI -My Dear Moments-</i>, combined with the lead writer's passion for science fiction and extensive reading of Golden Age sci-fi classics (plus, bionic humans are adorable), we set out to create this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STAFF LIST：</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Director</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >辰火</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Scriptwriter</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >剧本&amp;演出：辰火</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >剧本协力：R号机</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>PROGRAMMER</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>主程序：空白</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI程序：孤晚的爱上夜晚</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >程序协力：浅唱</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>ART</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >人物立绘&amp;CG插画：Ratto</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >机器人立绘：ゆ龍</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >场景插画：34</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q版插画：ゆ龍、浮游</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI设计：冷淡</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>VA</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >小希cv：云生</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >影cv：樱酱</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MUSIC</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PV音乐：雨观</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>BGM、音效收集：R号机</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>OTHER</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>PV制作：Season</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >主题曲（ed）制作：Whilist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >周边制作：予薇</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>OTHER HELP</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >浅唱、无语死了、祖安青年、苏格拉没有底、达瓦里氏、本夕、小水星、昼伏夜出的黯白猫猫、忆与秋叶、清弈云时</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>THANKS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过摩点赞助《海蓝星之梦》的各位玩家！</p>", "short_description": "老师，我曾经做过一个梦，在梦里，我看见了学院以外的世界，博士说，只要完成毕业考试，我就能去到那里，您能帮助我完成考试的复习吗？", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/header.jpg?t=1770382429", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/63cfb042cfc3a22670318e10b5ea8cbfbae73c29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770382429", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/63cfb042cfc3a22670318e10b5ea8cbfbae73c29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770382429", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64位 处理器 或 Intel Core 2 Duo 或更高<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 或 DirectX 11 兼容显卡<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 或 Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Core i5 或同级处理器<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 支持 DirectX 11 或 OpenGL 3.3 的显卡<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon或 Intel Core 处理器<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 支持 OpenGL 2.0 或 DirectX 9.0c 的显卡<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3000 MB available space</li></ul>",